<html><head><title>What to evaluate and How</title><meta http-equiv="Content-Type" content="text/html; charset=UTF-8"></head><body><div style="margin: 0px; font-family: &quot; font-size: 12px&quot;;"><p style="margin: 16px 0px;"><font color="#000000"><span lang="EN-US" style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 30.225px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif;"><span style="margin: 0px;">Different partners will </span><span style="margin: 0px;">likely want</span><span style="margin: 0px;"> to evaluate different things.</span><span style="margin: 0px;"> </span><span style="margin: 0px;">Students</span><span style="margin: 0px;"> and </span><span style="margin: 0px;">educators</span><span style="margin: 0px;"> </span><span style="margin: 0px;">may</span><span style="margin: 0px;"> focus more on student </span><span style="margin: 0px;">outcomes</span><span style="margin: 0px;"> like </span><span style="margin: 0px;">grades</span><span style="margin: 0px;"> and </span><span style="margin: 0px;">academic</span><span style="margin: 0px;"> </span><span style="margin: 0px;">progress</span><span style="margin: 0px;">.</span></span><span lang="NL-NL" style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 30.225px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif;"><span style="margin: 0px"> </span><span style="margin: 0px">This</span><span style="margin: 0px"> </span><span style="margin: 0px">seems</span><span style="margin: 0px"> </span><span style="margin: 0px">very</span><span style="margin: 0px"> different </span><span style="margin: 0px">from</span><span style="margin: 0px"> </span><span style="margin: 0px">the</span><span style="margin: 0px"> </span><span style="margin: 0px">perspective</span><span style="margin: 0px"> of a policymaker or NGO, </span><span style="margin: 0px">who</span><span style="margin: 0px"> </span><span style="margin: 0px">may</span><span style="margin: 0px"> want </span><span style="margin: 0px">to</span><span style="margin: 0px"> </span><span style="margin: 0px">evaluate</span><span style="margin: 0px"> </span><span style="margin: 0px">the</span><span style="margin: 0px"> </span></span><span lang="NL-NL" style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 30.225px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif; font-weight: bold;"><span style="margin: 0px">solution </span><span style="margin: 0px">outcomes</span></span><span lang="NL-NL" style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 30.225px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif;"><span style="margin: 0px"> </span><span style="margin: 0px">for</span><span style="margin: 0px"> </span><span style="margin: 0px">the</span><span style="margin: 0px"> complex </span><span style="margin: 0px">problem</span><span style="margin: 0px">. We must </span><span style="margin: 0px">also</span><span style="margin: 0px"> </span><span style="margin: 0px">not</span><span style="margin: 0px"> </span><span style="margin: 0px">forget</span><span style="margin: 0px"> </span><span style="margin: 0px">the</span><span style="margin: 0px"> </span></span><span lang="NL-NL" style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 30.225px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif; font-weight: bold;"><span style="margin: 0px">invisible</span><span style="margin: 0px"> </span><span style="margin: 0px">outcomes</span></span><span lang="NL-NL" style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 30.225px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif;"><span style="margin: 0px"> of </span><span style="margin: 0px">the</span><span style="margin: 0px"> </span><span style="margin: 0px">transdisciplinary</span><span style="margin: 0px"> </span><span style="margin: 0px">education</span><span style="margin: 0px"> </span><span style="margin: 0px">process</span><span style="margin: 0px">, </span><span style="margin: 0px">such</span><span style="margin: 0px"> as </span><span style="margin: 0px">the</span><span style="margin: 0px"> development of </span><span style="margin: 0px">competencies</span><span style="margin: 0px"> </span><span style="margin: 0px">among</span><span style="margin: 0px"> </span><span style="margin: 0px">all</span><span style="margin: 0px"> partners, </span><span style="margin: 0px">the</span><span style="margin: 0px"> </span><span style="margin: 0px">collaboration</span><span style="margin: 0px"> </span><span style="margin: 0px">process</span><span style="margin: 0px">, </span><span style="margin: 0px">and</span><span style="margin: 0px"> </span><span style="margin: 0px">the</span><span style="margin: 0px"> </span></span><span lang="NL-NL" style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 30.225px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif; font-weight: bold;">spin-off</span><span lang="NL-NL" style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 30.225px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif;"><span style="margin: 0px"> </span><span style="margin: 0px">the</span><span style="margin: 0px"> project </span><span style="margin: 0px">generates</span><span style="margin: 0px"> in </span><span style="margin: 0px">various</span><span style="margin: 0px"> </span><span style="margin: 0px">contexts</span><span style="margin: 0px">. In </span><span style="margin: 0px">an</span><span style="margin: 0px"> </span><span style="margin: 0px">evaluation</span><span style="margin: 0px"> </span><span style="margin: 0px">that</span><span style="margin: 0px"> does </span><span style="margin: 0px">justice</span><span style="margin: 0px"> </span><span style="margin: 0px">to</span><span style="margin: 0px"> </span><span style="margin: 0px">the</span><span style="margin: 0px"> </span></span><span lang="NL-NL" style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 30.225px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif; font-weight: bold;"><span style="margin: 0px">shared </span><span style="margin: 0px">and</span><span style="margin: 0px"> </span><span style="margin: 0px">potentially</span><span style="margin: 0px"> </span><span style="margin: 0px">evolving</span><span style="margin: 0px"> </span><span style="margin: 0px">learning</span><span style="margin: 0px"> </span><span style="margin: 0px">process</span></span><span lang="NL-NL" style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 30.225px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif;"><span style="margin: 0px"> in a </span><span style="margin: 0px">transdisciplinary</span><span style="margin: 0px"> project, these different </span><span style="margin: 0px">evaluation</span><span style="margin: 0px"> </span><span style="margin: 0px">outcomes</span><span style="margin: 0px"> must </span><span style="margin: 0px">coexist</span><span style="margin: 0px">.</span></span><span style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 30.225px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif;">&nbsp;</span></font></p></div><div style="margin: 0px; font-family: &quot; font-size: 12px&quot;;"><p style="margin: 16px 0px;"><font color="#000000"><span lang="NL-NL" style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 30.225px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif;"><span style="margin: 0px">On </span><span style="margin: 0px">the</span><span style="margin: 0px"> </span></span><span lang="NL-NL" style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 30.225px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif; font-weight: bold;"><span style="margin: 0px">practice</span><span style="margin: 0px"> page</span></span><span lang="NL-NL" style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 30.225px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif;"><span style="margin: 0px">, </span><span style="margin: 0px">you’ll</span><span style="margin: 0px"> </span><span style="margin: 0px">find</span><span style="margin: 0px"> </span><span style="margin: 0px">various</span><span style="margin: 0px"> types of </span><span style="margin: 0px">evaluation</span><span style="margin: 0px"> tools.</span></span><span style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 30.225px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif;">&nbsp;</span></font></p></div></body></html>